    },
    {
      "displayText": "흐흐...\n엄청난 사업을 구상하고 있으니 기대하라고.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D750D750002E002E002E000AC5C4CCADB09C0020C0ACC5C5C7440020AD6CC0C1D558ACE00020C788C73CB2C80020AE30B300D558B77CACE0002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "흐흐... 여기서부터 지하 수도로\n들어갈 수 있다는 거 알아?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D750D750002E002E002E0020C5ECAE30C11CBD80D1300020C9C0D5580020C218B3C4B85C000AB4E4C5B4AC080020C2180020C788B2E4B2940020AC700020C54CC544003F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "실은 내가 이 안에서 할 수 있는\n사업을 구상 중이거든...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2E4C7400020B0B4AC000020C7740020C548C5D0C11C0020D5600020C2180020C788B294000AC0ACC5C5C7440020AD6CC0C10020C911C774AC70B4E0002E002E002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바로 여기 있는 폭타와 함께\n뜨거운 사업을 할 거란 말씀!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B85C0020C5ECAE300020C788B2940020D3EDD0C0C6400020D568AED8000AB728AC70C6B40020C0ACC5C5C7440020D5600020AC70B7800020B9D0C5000021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포우!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECC6B0002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사례는 할 테니\n너도 도와주지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB840B2940020D5600020D14CB2C8000AB108B3C40020B3C4C640C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B798003F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "문은 열어 둘게.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n안에서 기다리고 있을 테니까\n무슨 일이 생겨도 괜찮으면 들어오도록 해.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB38C7400020C5F4C5B40020B458AC8C002E00100001BE01000AC548C5D0C11C0020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C7440020D14CB2C8AE4C000ABB34C2A80020C77CC7740020C0DDACA8B3C40020AD1CCC2EC73CBA740020B4E4C5B4C624B3C4B85D0020D574002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "흐흐... 기다리고 있었어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D750D750002E002E002E0020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C5C8C5B4002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어때, 이 방.\n적당히 축축한 것 같지 않아?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B54C002C0020C7740020BC29002E000AC801B2F9D7880020CD95CD95D55C0020AC830020AC19C9C00020C54AC544003F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "난 분명히 경고했어!\n‘무슨 일이 생겨도 괜찮으면’ 오라고 말이야.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그러니까 승부를 걸어도 상관없지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B09C0020BD84BA85D7880020ACBDACE0D588C5B40021000A2018BB34C2A80020C77CC7740020C0DDACA8B3C40020AD1CCC2EC73CBA7420190020C624B77CACE00020B9D0C774C57C002E00100001BE00000AADF8B7ECB2C8AE4C0020C2B9BD80B97C0020AC78C5B4B3C40020C0C1AD00C5C6C9C0003F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 폭타와\n뜨거운 승부를 겨뤄 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D3EDD0C0C640000AB728AC70C6B40020C2B9BD80B97C0020ACA8B9040020C9180021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비가 되면 말을 걸도록 해.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
