      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "졌지만 열기가 적당히 달아오른 덕분에\n드디어 시작할 수 있겠어...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C84CC9C0B9CC0020C5F4AE30AC000020C801B2F9D7880020B2ECC544C624B9780020B355BD84C5D0000AB4DCB514C5B40020C2DCC791D5600020C2180020C788ACA0C5B4002E002E002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "폭타 사우나를 말이야!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3EDD0C00020C0ACC6B0B098B97C0020B9D0C774C57C00210021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "폭타의 혹 안에 있는 1만 도의 마그마로\n이곳을 후끈하게 만들어서...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3EDD0C0C7580020D6390020C548C5D00020C788B29400200031B9CC0020B3C4C7580020B9C8ADF8B9C8B85C000AC774ACF3C7440020D6C4B048D558AC8C0020B9CCB4E4C5B4C11C002E002E002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "완벽한 열기의 사우나로 만드는 거야!\n이름 그대로 폭타 사우나!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이건 엄청난 사업이 될 거라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C644BCBDD55C0020C5F4AE30C7580020C0ACC6B0B098B85C0020B9CCB4DCB2940020AC70C57C0021000AC774B9840020ADF8B300B85C0020D3EDD0C00020C0ACC6B0B098002100100001BE00000AC774AC740020C5C4CCADB09C0020C0ACC5C5C7740020B4200020AC70B77CACE00021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기서요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30C11CC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "접근성이...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C811ADFCC131C774002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "드... 듣고 보니 그러네!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4DC002E002E002E0020B4E3ACE00020BCF4B2C80020ADF8B7ECB1240021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사우나에 안성맞춤인 장소지만\n접근성은 생각하지 못했어...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
