      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC0DCC0D00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이, 이 포켓몬들...\n엄청나게 기분 좋은 모양이네...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774002C0020C7740020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4002E002E002E000AC5C4CCADB098AC8C0020AE30BD840020C88BC7400020BAA8C591C774B124002E002E002E001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "설마, 이 녀석들...\n폭타 사우나가 마음에 든 건가!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C124B9C8002C0020C7740020B140C11DB4E4002E002E002E000AD3EDD0C00020C0ACC6B0B098AC000020B9C8C74CC5D00020B4E00020AC74AC000021003F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래, 결심했어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798002C0020ACB0C2ECD588C5B40021001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기를 야생 포켓몬들을 위한\n와일드한 폭타 사우나로 만들겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30B97C0020C57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7440020C704D55C000AC640C77CB4DCD55C0020D3EDD0C00020C0ACC6B0B098B85C0020B9CCB4E4ACA0C5B40021001000020114015B0000",
